 474:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.c ****                 IfxAdc_Tmadc_enableChannelEvent(channel, resltNode, IfxAdc_TmadcEventSel_result);
 475:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.c ****             }
