 716:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.c **** IfxAdc_Tmadc_Result IfxAdc_Tmadc_readRawResult(IfxAdc_Tmadc_Ch *channel)
