 355:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Dma/Std/IfxDma.h **** /** \brief Disable a DMA channel hardware transaction request.
 356:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Dma/Std/IfxDma.h ****  *
