1181:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Dma/Std/IfxDma.h **** /** \brief Returns and clears the pattern detection interrupt flag.
1182:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Dma/Std/IfxDma.h ****  *
