  27:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  *
  28:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  * Interface layer for TMADC functionality of converter.
  29:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  *
  30:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  *  \defgroup IfxLld_Adc_Tmadc_Usage How to use the TMADC Interface driver?
  31:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  *  \ingroup IfxLld_Adc
  32:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  *
  33:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  *  Design of module:
  34:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  *
  35:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  *  Initializations
  36:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  *
  37:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  *   1. Module configuration does high level settings and boundary value settings.
  38:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  *       a. It also assigns the SAR cores.
  39:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  *   2. Triggers are configured : user configures multiple triggers config with trigger sources.
  40:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  *       a. These triggers are then mapped to a group  or a channel as per user need
  41:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  *   3. A group configuration is only logical:
  42:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  *       a. It is for trigger uniformity
  43:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  *       b. It is also for interrupt configuration (all channels done interrupts)
  44:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  *   4. channel configuration does all the actual configurations:
  45:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  *       a. It picks up the appropriate configuration of trigger from channel  / group config
  46:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  *       b. It optionally initializes the interrupt if not part of a group  /or if user wants a sep
  47:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  *
  48:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  *  Run time:
  49:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  *
  50:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  *   1. Due to logical group concept implemented in driver, user can:
  51:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  *       a. Trigger  / read  / view state of individual channels
  52:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  *       b. Trigger / read  / view state of groups
  53:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  *
  54:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  *  How to use (Brief expectation):
  55:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  *
  56:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  *  Configuration
  57:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  *
  58:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  *   1. Configure module configuration data structure
  59:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  *       a. Emux configuration
  60:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  *       b. Boundary value registers configuration
  61:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  *       c. SAR core assignments
  62:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  *   2. Configure Trigger configuration data structure
  63:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  *       a. Select trigger sources
  64:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  *       b. Select trigger delays
  65:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  *       c. This can be mapped to a group / channel
  66:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  *   3. Configure an optional group data structure
  67:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  *       a. Select the trigger configuration
  68:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  *       b. Set all channels
  69:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  *       c. Configure the interrupt configuration
  70:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  *   4. Configure all channel data structure
  71:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  *       a. Sampling time / mode / channel ID
  72:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  *       b. Select the trigger (if not in group)
  73:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  *       c.Pin configuration
  74:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  *
  75:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  *  Initialization routine:
  76:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  *
  77:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  *   1. Module init  (IfxAdc_Tmadc_initModule())
  78:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  *       a. channel mapping
  79:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  *   2. Call the optional group init  (IfxAdc_Tmadc_initGroup())
  80:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  *       a. Interrupt initialize
  81:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  *       b. All applicable channel handles will be mapped to group handle
  82:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  *   3. Loop and Initialize all channels. (IfxAdc_Tmadc_initChannel)
  83:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  *       a.All initialization for channel done here
  84:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  *
  85:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  *  Steps to use the driver:
  86:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  *
  87:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  *  \section IfxLld_Adc_Tmadc_Preparation Preparation
  88:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  *  \subsection IfxLld_Adc_Tmadc_Include Include Files
  89:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  *
  90:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  *  Include following header file into your C code:
  91:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  *  \code
  92:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  *  #include <Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h>
  93:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  *  \endcode
  94:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  *
  95:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  *  \subsection IfxLld_Adc_Tmadc_Interrupt Interrupt Handler Installation
  96:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  *  See also \ref IfxLld_Cpu_Irq_Usage
  97:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  *
  98:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  *  Define priorities for the Interrupt handlers. This is normally done in the Ifx_IntPrioDef.h fil
  99:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  * \code
 100:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  * // priorities are normally defined in Ifx_IntPrioDef.h
 101:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  * #define IFX_INTPRIO_TMADC_SR0  1
 102:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  * #define IFX_INTPRIO_TMADC_SR1  2
 103:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  * #define IFX_INTPRIO_TMADC_SR2  3
 104:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  * \endcode
 105:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  *
 106:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  * Add the interrupt service routines to your C code:
 107:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  * \code
 108:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  * IFX_INTERRUPT(resultIsr, 0, IFX_INTPRIO_CDSP_SR0);
 109:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  * IFX_INTERRUPT(boundaryEventIsr,  0, IFX_INTPRIO_CDSP_SR1);
 110:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  *
 111:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  * IfxCpu_enableInterrupts();
 112:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  *
 113:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Tmadc/IfxAdc_Tmadc.h ****  * void resultIsr(void)
